; Tests live in test/ rather than inline, so this library needs no ppx and
; carries no test framework into the installed artifacts.
;
; Private on purpose: nothing outside this project consumes it, and giving it
; a public_name would install the .cmxa alongside the binary, whose references
; drag the whole OCaml toolchain into the runtime closure. Kept private it is
; simply linked into the executable.

(library
 (name miniflux_dedup)
 (libraries yojson))
